{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c696388fcba68defa85c27aa951d8c6bc93538c37320713952d979fcd187bb6c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:050227b8ef62fd477c57379504686e1d4dc4803a39bdc7a9d379a7e32b7d2f39",
      "text": "辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n这么晚突然打给你真不好意思。现在有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000008:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d343ca896cf656862d861688fd5198331ffd14c267246db044a087c376951e73",
      "text": "没问题哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a81c2c46068da59077b0a61e95c2af87180e343dc0e32dae4e0d5331f36df011",
      "text": "我和樱庭、翼3个人一边喝酒一边聊工作的事。\n不知不觉就超级想和你也聊聊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e2ea7548778305fe9243ee01e669e975d6f4cd531f57a65515c405be38e8c9f6",
      "text": "听着现场发生的事，我再次深深感到\n315 Pro里厉害的家伙真是一大堆啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab7294d368e3824327b954ac5c1a44c7a93d1050d20a5a49d86093875d27af26",
      "text": "我们……不是指翼他们，而是我和北斗、类，\n作为事务所的代表参加了演唱会嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000016:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9362662f022ef41ffe410803676e1d40b25e847ea9e4dda8304c47729ef0472b",
      "text": "谢谢你能选我做\n那群成员中的一员。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000018:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be8c022d97842e814e4468d75d57f004c02e2b611a0a1afcf2bb11bf104c227b",
      "text": "能成为这么厉害的家伙们的代表，太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a072c91ccbf8152bb916fbf7a9db08e91d839f0c4fe5695148d00bf49c9c4fe",
      "text": "能拜托给您\n真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5df1588710f5f7dc97572358d4049872908b19686bf2c41c1be1e5dd167b15fc",
      "text": "是不愧于代表之名的\n出色表演",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4327318ca3754847861cdb6a322d47456c0e2b4430451f59ca910abeafcef42",
      "text": "真的吗！要是看了我们的表演，\n对315 Pro感兴趣的人能变多就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000027:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62a828548a953ea3117faa47708edf3feda8bae855aeeace48455e657cad774f",
      "text": "……谢谢你听我说话，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:004ter_403_2_4_004_03_09_a:2_4_004_03_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:196c92de5db33c3f1c4e71ce6ba4ff4d7adb31e12fbdaa6e4a5ab5d714487d1e",
      "text": "下一次，为了能和315 Production的全员一起\n站在那里，我会努力的！那就晚安啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
